Package: mkv-extractor-qt6
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
XSBC-Original-Maintainer: Terence Belleguic <hizo@free.fr>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3:any, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, mkvtoolnix
Recommends: ffmpeg, python3-psutil
Suggests: tesseract-ocr
Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/mskpluk/MKV-Extractor-Qt6
Description: Graphical mkv demultiplexer
 Extracts, converts and remuxes the tracks of Matroska files.
 .
 Features:
  * DTS to AC3 conversion via ffmpeg
  * Automatic conversion from SUB to SRT via tesseract
  * Read and extract joined files
  * Extract and remux tracks
 .
 This is an unofficial build of Terence Belleguic's MKV Extractor Qt6,
 carrying the fixes listed in CHANGELOG.md. The upstream packages cannot
 be installed on Debian or Ubuntu because of a wrong dependency name.
